   "he": "וְהַמּוּרְיָיס. תָּנוּ רַבָּנַן: מוּרְיָיס אוּמָּן — מוּתָּר. רַבִּי יְהוּדָה בֶּן גַּמְלִיאֵל אוֹמֵר מִשּׁוּם רַבִּי חֲנִינָא בֶּן גַּמְלִיאֵל: אַף חִילָק אוּמָּן — מוּתָּר.",
   "en": "§ The mishna teaches that «fish stew» is prohibited. «The Sages taught: Fish stew» prepared by «an expert is permitted,» as professionals do not mix wine in it. «Rabbi Yehuda ben Gamliel says in the name of Rabbi Ḥanina ben Gamliel: Ḥilak» prepared by «an expert is also permitted.»"
  }
